{"summary":"铳楔是古代火器中的木楔，烧灰后用酒送服，可用于治疗难产，同时具有辟除邪气的功效。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"难产，烧灰酒服。又辟忤恶邪气（时珍）。","translation":"治疗难产，将铳楔烧成灰，用酒送服。另外，可以辟除邪恶之气。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#銃楔","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}